{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：09:47 2026-10-27 HKT<br/>發佈時間：09:47 2026-10-27 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：09:47 2026-10-27 HKT</p><img alt=\"專線小巴車頭損毀嚴重。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/1c8a89de142b6a2dd1690f3119e709ff/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-27_at_10_17_50_0.jpeg\"/><p>葵涌道1013至1033號昌年大廈對開，今（27日）早上9時11分，一部輕貨、一部中型貨車及一部94A專線小巴發生相撞意外，事件中初步有6女3男受傷，包括一名孕婦。救援人員在場處理傷者傷勢，稍後將他們送院治理。</p><p>現場所見，綠頂專線小巴車頭擋風玻璃爆裂，左車窗玻璃粉碎，車頭凹陷，損毀嚴重。</p><img alt=\"小巴車頭擋風玻璃爆裂。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0c43afc543e27918a75b7f46c4c4ef4b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-27_at_10_17_52.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c32252b62c432c1066e3825f2181db60/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-27_at_10_17_51_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"小巴擋風玻璃爆裂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5015d720ba7d98bb9c73a7e28b5393be/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-27_at_10_17_51.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"滿地玻璃碎。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/78e48d23b939ebd4405693bf97e906e3/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-27_at_10_17_50_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"小巴稍後被拖走檢驗。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/35882d41771fd104522d36f1621ecad2/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-27_at_10_17_50_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/62ca21402cc523f6f4caab7e7a906640/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-27_at_10_17_50.jpeg\"/><p>運輸署宣布，因交通意外，葵涌道（往九龍方向）近昌榮路迴旋處的部份行車線現已封閉。駕駛人士只可使用餘下行車線行車。現時上址交通繁忙。</p><img alt=\"fb馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c38c5c637f1d135932526d2a99a211a2/2026-10/1_10_41.jpg\" title=\"fb馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)圖片\"/><p>fb馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)圖片</p><img alt=\"現場交通擠塞。fb馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cfedd57a1eda38248c4d0f07236cd12b/2026-10/862344582_1117813550633069_2445509140512479116_n.jpg\" title=\"現場交通擠塞。fb馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)圖片\"/><p>現場交通擠塞。fb馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)圖片</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T02:41:51.259810+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":338,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T01:47:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T05:18:53.921080+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T02:38:33.718875+00:00","content_hash":"265b2f16b5982dec0e38d558c76e47745270084affd3b71ff376a09afe462f3b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}